    BVCVDVSUKZWCCGULWDVRVSVRTVTVSVRUMVSVRUNUOUPUQPVAVBVRVLNVEABURUSUTR $.

  $( Cancellation law for vector addition.  (Contributed by NM, 18-May-2005.)
