       is larger than ` A ` and there is nothing in between.  Definition 3.2.18
       of [PtakPulmannova] p. 68.  (Contributed by NM, 4-Jun-2004.)
       (New usage is discouraged.) $)
    cvbr $p |- ( ( A e. CH /\ B e. CH ) -> ( A <oH B <->
              ( A C. B /\ -. E. x e. CH ( A C. x /\ x C. B ) ) ) ) $=
